<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kinta Kellas 9-mth net up 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kinta Kellas 9-mth net up 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit	   25.62	  vs	    25.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)  16.2	  vs	    16.1</p>
<p>    Turnover	    121.21	  vs	   107.47</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     36.52	  vs	    35.94</p>
<p>Note: Full name of the company is Kinta Kellas Public Limited Company. It is engaged in property development and construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
